WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
(school bell rings)

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Peter Parker: I can't believe this happened

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
MJ: Peter, everything's gonna be okay

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Peter Parker: No, my identity is exposed. Everyone knows who I am

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Ned: Maybe Doctor Strange can help us

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Peter Parker: We have to go to him. There's no other way

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
(portal opening sound)

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Doctor Strange: Peter, this spell is very dangerous

9
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Peter Parker: Please, I just want everyone to forget I'm Spider-Man

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Doctor Strange: Okay, but anything you want to say?

11
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Peter Parker: No, just that...

12
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Doctor Strange: Too late! The spell is out of control

13
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
(explosion and blue light)

14
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Ned: Oh my god! What just happened?

15
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Doctor Strange: Portals to other worlds have opened

16
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
(heavy footsteps sound)

17
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Doc Ock: Well, who are we up against?

18
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Peter Parker: Who are you?

19
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Doc Ock: Otto Octavius. They call me Doctor Octopus

20
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.000
(Green Goblin appears)

21
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Green Goblin: Looks like we're having a party!

22
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Peel: Am I dreaming?

23
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Ned: If it's a dream, I've been asleep for a long time!

24
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
(Sandman sound)

25
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Electro: Finally, a place where everyone knows who I am

26
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.000
Peter Parker: I have to stop these guys

27
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Doctor Strange: No Peter, these hunters are after you

28
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Peter Parker: It's my fault. I have to fix it

29
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
(punch and explosion sound)

30
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Doc Ock: See? Your world is no different

31
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
(another Spider-Man sound)

32
00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Spider-Man 2: Hey, don't think you're alone!

33
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Peter Parker: You... you're me too?

34
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Spider-Man 2: Kind of. Long story

35
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.000
(Spider-Man 3 sound)

36
00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Spider-Man 3: Looks like you need some help, guys